  "_outcome_heading_exclusion_note": "BUG-695 (2026-11-09): a heading whose subject is a recommendation ('1. Recommendation for Conclusion 1', '(a) Recommendation for ...', 'Chapter 5: Recommendations') is not a results heading, even when it names a conclusion; recommendations are not results. Anchored at the start of the heading, after any numbering or chapter prefix, so 'Summary, Conclusions, and Recommendations' stays a results heading; a chapter title that lists recommendations with other sections ('Recommendations and Conclusions', 'Recommendations, Summary and Conclusions') stays one too.",
  "_source_v094": "2026-10-31 (V-094): scope/limitation/revision cues so the judge sees a manuscript's own delimitations; explicit 'objective not met' patterns that always reach the judge; the named-system guard for a contradiction between two different named systems (BUG-593). Precision-biased and data, like the rest of this file.",
